			"notes": "Add wet concrete bucket cubes in eight states.\nAdd item trowel:\n· Placement mode: Extract concrete from wet concrete buckets and fill empty frames.\n· Smooth mode: smooth wet concrete surface or apply wet concrete surface layer to other squares.\nRapid curing mode: directly fill and cure the concrete frame (double the concrete consumption).\n· Detail mode: add texture detail to the concrete cube (not perfect).\n· Recovery mode: remove the wet concrete surface layer and restore the original square.\nEngraving mode: engraving on hardened or reinforced concrete (not perfect).\nAdded the synthetic path of wet concrete bucket: mixing pot + sand + water + cement powder + mixing pot with right key of handheld wooden stick + empty bucket"
		},
